# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The exe is built by build.cmd in one command and published via GitHub
# Releases. Keeping binaries out of the repo also keeps a security tool
# auditable: what you read here is all there is.
*.exe
*.pdb
*.dll
bin/
obj/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime files, generated on first run — machine-specific, keep them local
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# config.json holds your own adapter names and program paths. See
# config.example.json for the schema; the app regenerates it on first run.
config.json
state/
logs/
selftest-result.txt

